  "description": "Add-on IFileExtractors for Scrubkit that read email files: .eml (MIME) and .msg (Outlook / OLE2). The From/To/Cc/Subject/Date fields become metadata and the message body becomes text. Handles multipart MIME, base64 and quoted-printable encodings, common charsets, RFC 2047 encoded-word headers, and the Outlook compound-file format — fully offline with no dependencies beyond Scrubkit.Abstractions. Register them via ReadOptions.Extractors.",
